{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨晚（30日）10時許，警方接獲途人報案，一名疑飲醉酒的外籍男子，在佐敦廟街190號一間酒吧一帶徘徊，懷疑持有武器。警員帶齊裝備接報到場，在酒吧鄰近唐樓樓梯口截獲該名男子，檢獲仿製曲尺手槍，並以涉嫌「管有仿製槍械」罪名作出拘捕。</p><p>據了解，被捕男子年約46歲，來自澳洲。就現場所見，疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車，警方在場調查。</p><p>根據網上圖片，反恐特勤隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備頭盔和防彈衣等裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。</p><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124265583939584013895.jpeg/e_p4R0_TvkTEEeFnxiwrDpEYrynD3Y8CVjexSlY3sUo\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124358965923840381072.jpeg/dolo4xwk8pVL76FBq2h1QvyDsD91KpcKVTTeslU03rI\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備，部份警員更持槍，並在樓梯口戒備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124741566140416312678.jpeg/t3bygyu4tImC4DClzHk3ZvKF5ecqWKZuF7XzcBe183A\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124744451952640138702.jpeg/dnBvxoYu1jnLvMahv7aPMYJu9vVRPOTDLg9T_C4PU_w\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124747312599040513490.jpeg/B1eLOqkNyHTMTDC8z7di3D9arqmSswj-WieXnVonl50\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124749988696064690185.jpeg/10LUjxei0oqdHBirhUfzh0qTdjOjbKzQx4t1_seLdf4\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182124752778039296673805.jpeg/WlEJbVLgrLpDp3FkuWl9C4ikJIQSFGVBcFRPa3BUT2s\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@fffff999_0711圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@handsomebb999圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182133475931590656836250.jpeg/oij--qy-YWHlyzPw0BjOLx9YS0ghlmmcmHkuhZh5LoU\"/><figcaption>反恐特警隊和衝鋒隊到場，配備裝備。（Threads@handsomebb999圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120028896497664682495.jpeg/c_v14rOh-XmtfwJeoSaTVKDR2wJBbfzEmzeuR6E3rkc\"/><figcaption>疑犯黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120032256266240370429.jpeg/L7F53ZXA9ZiE3lCbSUrwckMv9qW12AeO1VYgbO9WIGw\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120584784646144195407.jpeg/u-5nhtgBdgwizroKSWu4-9d7JIs91hgKn0onhqVKJ4Y\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120580510519296980265.jpeg/1zmtx8vqbVB6dfVf9GZ5sMveQHrD3EWKuRWzKoMVsyo\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261001/1182120576811012096371628.jpeg/YaY6vCd1WRmGhdjxKM3X1ABVuE_1F6Xd_u2YS8TtmEs\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T17:19:13.355977+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":644,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}